{
  "declaredLength": 2664,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "喂！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5582FF01001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是你，\n现在方便吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F4F60FF0C000A73B0572865B94FBF5417FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "之前因为黏黏宝的事盘问你，\n还怀疑你，很抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4B524D56E04E3A9ECF9ECF5B9D76844E8B76D895EE4F60FF0C000A8FD8600075914F60FF0C5F8862B16B493002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，我只是想跟你道歉\n才叫住你的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C621153EA662F60F38DDF4F6090536B49000A624D53EB4F4F4F6076843002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我正在忙“密阿雷美术馆劫案”的事呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116B6357285FD9201C5BC6963F96F77F8E672F998652AB6848201D76844E8B54623002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是个大事件呀！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F4E2A59274E8B4EF65440FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我协助你",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211534F52A94F600000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不好意思，好像让你误会了。\n这只是个训练而已。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D597D610F601DFF0C597D50CF8BA94F608BEF4F1A4E863002000A8FD953EA662F4E2A8BAD7EC3800C5DF23002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷警察会定期进行训练。\n这次的设定是美术馆被坏人盯上了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F78B665BDF4F1A5B9A671F8FDB884C8BAD7EC33002000A8FD96B2176848BBE5B9A662F7F8E672F998688AB574F4EBA76EF4E0A4E863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B4920262026001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你也来帮忙吧！\n毕竟我知道你的实力有多强。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E5F67655E2E5FD95427FF01000A6BD57ADF621177E590534F6076845B9E529B6709591A5F3A3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你扮演劫匪，\n袭击密阿雷美术馆吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60626E6F1452AB532AFF0C000A88AD51FB5BC6963F96F77F8E672F99865427FF01001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等你做好准备，\n就跟我搭话吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494F60505A597D51C65907FF0C000A5C318DDF6211642D8BDD54273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你准备好要成为劫匪……\n不是，要假装成劫匪了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6051C65907597D898162104E3A52AB532A20262026000A4E0D662FFF0C8981504788C5621052AB532A4E865417FF1F001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备好了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907597D4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次训练的成果\n取决于你拿出多少真本事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B218BAD7EC376846210679C000A53D651B34E8E4F6062FF51FA591A5C11771F672C4E8B3002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，让我们开始训练吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C8BA962114EEC5F0059CB8BAD7EC354273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你的任务\n是从美术馆入口进去。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n然后抢走2楼展示的\n古代神奥人的服装。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n途中会有警官想逮捕你，并向你发起对战。\n你就好好应战吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，挡在你面前的警官们可都是\n密阿雷警察局里出类拔萃的精英。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C632157284F609762524D76848B665B984EEC53EF90FD662F000A5BC6963F96F78B665BDF5C4091CC51FA7C7B62D4840376847CBE82F13002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，你从屋顶跳下去，\n开始训练吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C4F604ECE5C4B98768DF34E0B53BBFF0C000A5F0059CB8BAD7EC354273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你忘记训练的路线了吗？\n要从正面进入美术馆。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605FD88BB08BAD7EC376848DEF7EBF4E865417FF1F000A89814ECE6B6397628FDB51657F8E672F99863002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "站住！\n否则我就让宝可梦出招了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是这样的训练啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7AD94F4FFF01000A5426521962115C318BA95B9D53EF68A651FA62DB4E86FF0100100001BE00000A5C31662F8FD9683776848BAD7EC35566300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "训练失败了！\n从头再来一次吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BAD7EC359318D254E86FF01000A4ECE5934518D67654E006B2154273002001000020114002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正面被突破了！\n劫匪正在前往你那边！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是这样的训练啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B63976288AB7A8178344E86FF01000A52AB532A6B635728524D5F804F6090A38FB9FF0100100001BE00000A5C31662F8FD9683776848BAD7EC35566300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～！\n有人抢劫～～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5EFF01000A67094EBA62A252ABFF5EFF5EFF0100100002011400230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "2楼展示的古代神奥人的服装\n要被抢走了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0032697C5C55793A768453E44EE3795E59654EBA7684670D88C5000A898188AB62A28D704E86FF0100100002011400230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～！\n有人抢劫～～！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5EFF01000A67094EBA62A252ABFF5EFF5EFF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样下去，2楼的古代神奥人的\n服装会……！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E0B53BBFF0C0032697C768453E44EE3795E59654EBA7684000A670D88C54F1A20262026FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请停止可疑的举动。\n你从正面闯入美术馆，我要逮捕你！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7505C6B6253EF759176844E3E52A83002000A4F604ECE6B63976295EF51657F8E672F9986FF0C62118981902E63554F60FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "继正面之后，\n柜台的警戒线也被突破了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7EE76B6397624E4B540EFF0C000A67DC53F076848B6662127EBF4E5F88AB7A8178344E86FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽说是训练，\n但输了还是会挨骂的……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D8BF4662F8BAD7EC3FF0C000A4F468F934E868FD8662F4F1A63289A8276842026202600100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到此为止。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52306B644E3A6B62300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这已经不是训练了，\n我要认真挑战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95DF27ECF4E0D662F8BAD7EC34E86FF0C000A621189818BA4771F63116218FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n盗走了古代神奥人的服装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000000A76D78D704E8653E44EE3795E59654EBA7684670D88C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古代神奥人的服装被\n稀世怪盗<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>盗走了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请布下包围网，\n别让<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她逃出密阿雷市！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E44EE3795E59654EBA7684670D88C588AB000A7A004E16602A76D7001000020100000076D78D704E86300200100001BE01000A8BF75E034E0B530556F47F51FF0C000A522B8BA900100003110000FF01014ED65979900351FA5BC6963F96F75E02FF0100100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次训练很不错。\n但报告可不太好写啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B218BAD7EC35F884E0D95193002000A4F4662A5544A53EF4E0D592A597D5199554A300200100002011401CD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "今后的训练\n好像会更加困难。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǍ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ECA540E76848BAD7EC3000A597D50CF4F1A66F452A056F096BE300200100002011401CD0000",
